// Wraps the caster in a veil of stillness, turning them unseen and shielding
// them from every form of remote sensing. Combines both of this game's
// anti-perception primitives: unconditional anti-divination (Nondetection)
// plus a very large Stealth contribution meant to drive
// combat::perception_dist_multiplier_from_stealth toward zero. strength:
// 20.0 -> stealth_multiplier(20.0) = 1/(1+20) ~= 0.0476, comfortably under
// the "functionally invisible" 0.05 bar for a level-7 capstone (compare
// mooncloak's strength: 1.5 -> 0.4).
//
// Scope: only the anti-divination + concealment halves are modeled. The
// source spell's stasis/suspended-animation half (target can't act or be
// acted upon) is out of scope -- no such mechanic is built here.
//
// The source spell's real duration is "until a condition breaks it" (no
// timer); this engine has no conditional-break mechanism, so this ships as a
// very long fixed duration instead -- one game-week (604800s), clearly
// longer than nondetection's 8-hour neighbor and functionally permanent for
// any single play session, while staying bounded for buff-storage/save
// sanity. Same narrowing spirit as seeming.ron's dropped
// unwilling-target-resists clause.
//
// Self-only, same Touch-range-SelfBuff narrowing nondetection.ron documents.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(
            kind: Sequester,
            data: BuffData(
                strength: 20.0,
                duration: Some(604800.0),
            ),
        ),
    ],
    energy_cost: 180,
    enforced_limit: false,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Transmutation),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 7 spell -> min_level 42, same level*6 convention
        // seeming.ron documents.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(42)),
    ),
)
